      "content": "thanks. it looks okay but feels a bit like a news report rather than something a city office would send out. can we make it sound a bit more \"inspiring\"? i want people to feel like the city is moving in the right direction and being proactive about the future. maybe lean into the benefits of the plan a bit more?",
